#! ia 1.0

@convention canon-one-workspace-per-root
  meaning
    says "Several @workspace records may declare one source root, and sharing a root is supported. The default is one workspace per source root; share a root only for records shared by design, such as an organisation scope several departments read."
    answers "May several workspaces declare one source root, and what is the default?"
  governance
    severity advisory
    requires "Declare a source root in one workspace by default, and share it among several only for records shared by design."
  subject
    subject-word workspace
  relationships
    cites @agent public-workspace-system-steward
